SUMMARY:PMP: Spring Concert
DESCRIPTION:PMP: Spring Concert\nMay 9\, 2026 at 4:00 p.m.\nShea Auditorium at William Paterson University\, Wayne\nFREE Event\nSuggested donation of canned or dry food. \nLeap into spring with PMP’s advanced ensembles! Featuring Silk City Symphony\, Symphonic Band\, Harmony Strings\, School 6’s Senators of Swing\, Guitar Ensemble\, and more.
