SUMMARY:Discover the Magic of the Harp
DESCRIPTION:Discover the Magic of the Harp\nFree Intro Lessons with Faculty Member Diane Michaels \nSaturday\, May 30\n10:30–11:00 a.m.\n11:15–11:45 a.m.\nAdditional session may be added. \nWharton Performing Arts School\n60 Locust Avenue\nBerkeley Heights \nFREE Event.\nCLICK HERE to reserve your spot. \nImagine the soothing sound of the harp—now imagine bringing that sound to life yourself. Whether you already play an instrument or are taking your very first step into music\, the harp is a welcoming and gentle place to begin. Join us for a free\, introductory harp experience and explore this beautiful instrument in a relaxed\, supportive setting. \nWhat to Expect: \n• Hands-on introduction to the harp\n• Meet instructor Diane Michaels\n• Perfect for beginners of all ages\n• No experience necessary \nSpecial Offer: \n• Trial Lesson Package Available\n• Opportunities to join the Adult Harp Circle & Private Lessons for All Ages & Abilities
URL:https://whartonarts.org/calendar/discover-the-magic-of-the-harp/
LOCATION:Wharton Institute for the Performing Arts\, 60 Locust Avenue\, Berkeley Heights\, NJ\, 07922\, United States
CATEGORIES:PAS,Wharton
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://whartonarts.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Adult-Harp-Circle-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
